# This directory is used to store local Skill packages installed from ClawHub
# Each Skill has a subdirectory containing SKILL.md + scripts/ + references/ + assets/
# For example:
#   skills/
#   ├── ifind-repilot-finance-data-search/
#   │   ├── SKILL.md
#   │   ├── scripts/
#   │   │   └── fetch_data.py
#   │   └── references/
#   └── weather-query/
#       ├── SKILL.md
#       └── scripts/
#           └── weather.py
